      "html": "<section class=\"font-sans text-slate-800\"> <nav class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 bg-[#0A1F44]/95 backdrop-blur border-b border-[#C9A227]/40\"> <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\"> <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"> <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#D4AF37] to-[#C9A227] flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-[#0A1F44] font-bold text-lg\">BEP</div> <span class=\"text-[#D4AF37] font-serif text-xl tracking-wide\">Bristh Enrollment Partners</span> </div> <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"hidden md:inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D4AF37] to-[#C9A227] text-[#0A1F44] font-semibold px-5 py-2 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#C9A227]/50 transition\">索取合作案</a> </div> </nav> <div class=\"relative bg-[#0A1F44] text-white overflow-hidden\"> <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20\" data-image-placeholder=\"英国校园/古典建筑全景大图\"></div> <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#D4AF37] to-transparent\"></div> <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#D4AF37] to-transparent\"></div> <div class=\"relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-32 md:py-40 text-center\"> <p class=\"tracking-[0.3em] text-[#D4AF37] text-sm font-semibold mb-6\">诚邀英国院校 · 战略合作</p> <h1 class=\"font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6\">您的招生蓝图，<span class=\"text-[#D4AF37]\">已在中国落地</span></h1> <p class=\"text-lg md:text-2xl text-slate-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-4 font-serif italic\">We are your shared enrollment infrastructure, based in the UK.</p> <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12\">Bristh Enrollment Partners 是驻扎英国本土、服务大中华区市场的共享招生基础设施——为贵校提供全托管访校执行、代理网络治理与本地化市场代表，让招生团队专注于教育本身。</p> <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"> <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D4AF37] to-[#C9A227] text-[#0A1F44] font-bold text-lg px-10 py-4 rounded-full shadow-2xl hover:scale-105 transition transform\">索取合作案 →</a> <a href=\"#value\" class=\"border-2 border-[#D4AF37] text-[#D4AF37] font-semibold text-lg px-10 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-[#D4AF37] hover:text-[#0A1F44] transition\">了解我们的服务</a> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"value\" class=\"bg-slate-50 py-24\"> <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6\"> <div class=\"text-center mb-16\"> <p class=\"text-[#C9A227] font-semibold tracking-widest text-sm mb-3\">OUR VALUE</p> <h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#0A1F44]\">我们为英国院校解决的三大核心难题</h2> <div class=\"w-24 h-1 bg-[#C9A227] mx-auto mt-6 rounded-full\"></div> </div> <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"> <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition p-8 border-t-4 border-[#C9A227] relative overflow-hidden\"> <div class=\"absolute -right-6 -top-6 w-24 h-24 bg-[#0A1F44]/5 rounded-full\"></div> <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0A1F44] to-[#14213D] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-[#D4AF37] text-3xl\">✈</div> <h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1F44] mb-3\">全托管访校执行</h3> <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">从行程规划、当地接待、招生宣讲到媒体曝光，我们提供端到端的中国访校全托管服务，让校方代表安全高效地触达真实生源家庭，无需自建本地团队。</p> </div> <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition p-8 border-t-4 border-[#C9A227] relative overflow-hidden\"> <div class=\"absolute -right-6 -top-6 w-24 h-24 bg-[#0A1F44]/5 rounded-full\"></div> <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0A1F44] to-[#14213D] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-[#D4AF37] text-3xl\">🤝</div> <h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1F44] mb-3\">代理网络统一管理</h3> <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">大中华区代理生态庞杂、良莠不齐。我们代表校方甄选、培训、监督并考核合作代理，统一佣金结算与合规标准，杜绝招生乱象，保障品牌声誉。</p> </div> <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition p-8 border-t-4 border-[#C9A227] relative overflow-hidden\"> <div class=\"absolute -right-6 -top-6 w-24 h-24 bg-[#0A1F44]/5 rounded-full\"></div> <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0A1F44] to-[#14213D] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-[#D4AF37] text-3xl\">📍</div> <h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1F44] mb-3\">本地化市场代表</h3> <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">我们的本地团队常驻大中华区核心城市，以校方名义开展常态化市场维护、家长答疑与关系维系，成为贵校在当地看得见、找得到的常驻窗口。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"bg-[#0A1F44] text-white py-24 relative overflow-hidden\"> <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10\" data-image-placeholder=\"中国地图/大中华区城市连线纹理背景\"></div> <div class=\"relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6\"> <div class=\"text-center mb-16\"> <p class=\"text-[#D4AF37] font-semibold tracking-widest text-sm mb-3\">TRUST & METRICS</p> <h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold\">数据背后的招生实力</h2> <div class=\"w-24 h-1 bg-[#D4AF37] mx-auto mt-6 rounded-full\"></div> </div> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"> <div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-[#D4AF37]/30 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center backdrop-blur\"> <p class=\"font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#D4AF37] mb-2\">12+</p> <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm\">大中华区核心城市覆盖</p> </div> <div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-[#D4AF37]/30 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center backdrop-blur\"> <p class=\"font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#D4AF37] mb-2\">300+</p> <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm\">受管理认证代理网络</p> </div> <div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-[#D4AF37]/30 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center backdrop-blur\"> <p class=\"font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#D4AF37] mb-2\">80+</p> <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm\">合作英国院校</p> </div> <div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-[#D4AF37]/30 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center backdrop-blur\"> <p class=\"font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#D4AF37] mb-2\">5000+</p> <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm\">年协助学生申请量</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"mt-16 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-center\"> <div class=\"h-40 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10\" data-image-placeholder=\"访校活动实拍照片1\"></div> <div class=\"h-40 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10\" data-image-placeholder=\"访校活动实拍照片2\"></div> <div class=\"h-40 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10\" data-image-placeholder=\"代理培训会现场照片\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"bg-slate-50 py-24\"> <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center mb-12\"> <p class=\"text-[#C9A227] font-semibold tracking-widest text-sm mb-3\">TESTIMONIAL</p> <h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#0A1F44] mb-6\">来自合作院校的信任</h2> <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-10 border-l-4 border-[#C9A227]\"> <p class=\"text-slate-600 italic text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6\">“BEP 让我们第一次真正掌控了在华招生的每一个环节，从访校到代理，透明且高效。”</p> <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-4\"> <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-slate-200\" data-image-placeholder=\"英国院校招生主任头像\"></div> <div class=\"text-left\"> <p class=\"font-semibold text-[#0A1F44]\">招生主任</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">英国某知名私立中学</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"contact\" class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0A1F44] to-[#14213D] py-24 relative\"> <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#D4AF37] to-transparent\"></div> <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6\"> <div class=\"text-center mb-14\"> <p class=\"text-[#D4AF37] font-semibold tracking-widest text-sm mb-3\">GET IN TOUCH</p> <h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">开启与大中华区的战略合作</h2> <p class=\"text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">填写以下信息，我们的团队将在 24 小时内为贵校发送定制版《合作方案书》。</p> </div> <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start\"> <form class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-8 space-y-5\"> <div> <label class=\"block text-sm font-semibold text-[#0A1F44] mb-2\">学校名称</label> <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"请输入贵校全称\" class=\"w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#C9A227]\"/> </div> <div> <label class=\"block text-sm font-semibold text-[#0A1F44] mb-2\">联系人姓名</label> <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"请输入联系人姓名\" class=\"w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#C9A227]\"/> </div> <div> <label class=\"block text-sm font-semibold text-[#0A1F44] mb-2\">工作邮箱</label> <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@school.ac.uk\" class=\"w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#C9A227]\"/> </div> <div> <label class=\"block text-sm font-semibold text-[#0A1F44] mb-2\">合作意向留言</label> <textarea rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"请简要描述贵校的招生需求或合作意向\" class=\"w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#C9A227]\"></textarea> </div> <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D4AF37] to-[#C9A227] text-[#0A1F44] font-bold text-lg py-3 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#C9A227]/50 transition\">提交并索取合作案</button> </form> <div class=\"text-slate-200 space-y-6\"> <div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-[#D4AF37]/30 rounded-2xl p-6\"> <h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#D4AF37] mb-4\">联系方式</h3> <p class=\"mb-2\">📍 英国总部：London, United Kingdom</p> <p class=\"mb-2\">🏙 大中华区办公室：上海 · 香港 · 台北</p> <p class=\"mb-2\">✉️ partnerships@bristhep.co.uk</p> <p class=\"mb-2\">📞 +44 (0) 20 0000 0000</p> </div> <div class=\"h-48 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10\" data-image-placeholder=\"公司团队合影或办公室实景照片\"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <footer class=\"bg-[#071530] text-slate-400 py-10\"> <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\"> <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"> <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#D4AF37] to-[#C9A227] flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-[#0A1F44] font-bold text-sm\">BEP</div> <span class=\"text-slate-300 font-serif\">Bristh Enrollment Partners</span> </div> <p class=\"text-sm\">© 2025 Bristh Enrollment Partners. 驻英大中华区共享招生基础设施。保留所有权利。</p> </div> </footer> </section>"
